          "name": "get_review_queue_flow",
          "description": "List the verified reviewer's team queue: OPEN cases ordered by reply-due date, with case_id, request, author (first name + surname initial), manuscript_id, opened date, age in days, reply-due date, sla_status (ON_TRACK, DUE_TODAY, OVERDUE) and requested amount. Status EMPTY = no open cases; NOT_REVIEWER = not a reviewer token.",
          "schemas": {
