        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "get_review_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Open one case from the reviewer's team queue: request, status, author (first name + surname initial), the author's statement, the AI-prepared agent_brief (unverified), requested amount, max_approvable, the reviewer's own approval limit, facts from the publisher's records (APC, agreement coverage and waivers, or the submission check) and the decision options. Another team's case or an unknown id returns NOT_FOUND.",
