    {
      "id": "flow:get_review_case_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "get_review_case_flow",
        "description": "Open one case from the reviewer&#39;s team queue: request, status, author (first name + surname initial), the author&#39;s statement, the AI-prepared agent_brief (unverified), requested amount, max_approvable, the reviewer&#39;s own approval limit, facts from the publisher&#39;s records (APC, agreement coverage and waivers, or the submission check) and the decision options. Another team&#39;s case or an unknown id returns NOT_FOUND.",
